## 18. Analytics & Weekly Review

Check **Professional Dashboard → Insights** weekly.

| Metric | Question | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Reach (followers vs non-followers) | Are we reaching new people? | Make more discovery-friendly Reels |
| Watch time & retention | Where do people leave? | Fix hook and pacing |
| Sends / shares | Is it worth sharing? | Add more useful, relatable content |
| Saves | Is it valuable to keep? | Make more carousels and checklists |
| Profile visits → follows | Does the profile convert? | Improve bio, pinned posts, highlights |
| Audience location | US/UK/CA/AU share? | Adjust language and topics |
| Link taps / DMs | Are we generating leads? | Test CTAs and offers |
| Trial Reel results | Which hooks win? | Publish winners |

**Monthly rule:** Remake your top 3 Reels with a stronger hook or new angle.

