## 19. Mistakes to Avoid

1. Posting random AI topics with no clear niche
2. Reposting TikTok videos with watermarks
3. Slow intros
4. Text hidden behind Instagram UI
5. Bad audio
6. Skipping fact-checks on AI news
7. Hashtag stuffing
8. Not labeling realistic AI content
9. Ignoring DMs, Stories, and comments
10. No offer or link, so followers never convert
11. Depending on one platform
12. Buying followers, joining pods, or faking location
13. Giving up before month 3

